  "body": "<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\"><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\" title=\"hi\">魚<rt class=\"tli-rt\">희-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\" title=\"à\">仔<rt class=\"tli-rt\">아ˋ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ybfWYpYhTQQ?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    去學校的路很久沒走\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    qù xué xiào de lù hěn jiǔ méi zǒu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    最近也換了新的工作\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    zuì jìn yě huàn le xīn de gōng zuò\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    所有的追求 是不是缺少了什麼\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    suǒ yǒu de zhuī qiú shì bù shì quē shǎo le shén me\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    想像著生活 風平浪靜\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    xiǎng xiàng zhe shēng huó fēng píng làng jìng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    打開了窗戶 突然想起\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    dǎ kāi le chuāng hù tū rán xiǎng qǐ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    你在的世界 會不會很靠近水星\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    nǐ zài de shì jiè huì bù huì hěn kào jìn shuǐ xīng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">看<rt class=\"tli-rt\">콸ˋ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">魚仔<rt class=\"tli-rt\">희아ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">佇<rt class=\"tli-rt\">듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>햐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">泅<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슈-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">來<rt class=\"tli-rt\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">泅<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슈-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">去<rt class=\"tli-rt\">킈</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">泅<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슈-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">來<rt class=\"tli-rt\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">泅<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슈-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">去<rt class=\"tli-rt\">킈</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khoà̰-hi-à ti-hiâ siu-lai-siu-khi siu-lai-siu-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">對<rt class=\"tli-rt\">뒤ˋ</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">想<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슐-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">來<rt class=\"tli-rt\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">想<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슐-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">去<rt class=\"tli-rt\">킈</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">想<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슐-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">來<rt class=\"tli-rt\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">想<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슐-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">去<rt class=\"tli-rt\">킈</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà tùi-lì siṵ-lai-siṵ-khi siṵ-lai-siṵ-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">這<rt class=\"tli-rt\">짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">幾<rt class=\"tli-rt\">귀ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">冬<rt class=\"tli-rt\">당ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">拍拚<rt class=\"tli-rt\">팧ˆ뱔</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">佮<rt class=\"tli-rt\">갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">認真<rt class=\"tli-rt\">띤진ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jît-kûi-tâng goà’e phâh-pia̰ kâh-rin-jîn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">攏<rt class=\"tli-rt\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">是<rt class=\"tli-rt\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">因為<rt class=\"tli-rt\">인ˉ위-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lông-si-īn-wi-lì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">花<rt class=\"tli-rt\">훼ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">佇<rt class=\"tli-rt\">듸-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">風中<rt class=\"tli-rt\">헝ˉ뎡ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">搖<rt class=\"tli-rt\">요-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">來<rt class=\"tli-rt\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">搖<rt class=\"tli-rt\">요-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">去<rt class=\"tli-rt\">킈</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">搖<rt class=\"tli-rt\">요-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">來<rt class=\"tli-rt\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">搖<rt class=\"tli-rt\">요-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">去<rt class=\"tli-rt\">킈</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    huê ti-hōng-tiông yo-lai-yo-khi yo-lai-yo-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">對<rt class=\"tli-rt\">뒤ˋ</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">想<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슐-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">來<rt class=\"tli-rt\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">想<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슐-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">去<rt class=\"tli-rt\">킈</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">想<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슐-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">到<rt class=\"tli-rt\">ᄀᅷˋ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">半暝<rt class=\"tli-rt\">봘ˋ미ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà tùi-lì siṵ-lai-siṵ-khi siṵ-kàu-poà̰-mí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">希望<rt class=\"tli-rt\">히ˉ빵-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">月光<rt class=\"tli-rt\">뀋긍ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">𤆬<rt class=\"tli-rt\">촤-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">轉<rt class=\"tli-rt\">등ˋ</rt></ruby>’래 <ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">身邊<rt class=\"tli-rt\">신ˉ빌ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hī-bang-gueh-kn̂g choa-lì tǹg’lai gûn-sīn-pḭ̂\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    如果我也變成一條魚\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    rú guǒ wǒ yě biàn chéng yī tiáo yú\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    如果你也變成了氧氣\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    rú guǒ nǐ yě biàn chéng le yǎng qì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    未來多美好 不想要一個人承受\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    wèi lái duō měi hǎo bù xiǎng yào yī gè rén chéng shòu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    我需要你 需要你 需要你陪伴我\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    wǒ xū yào nǐ xū yào nǐ xū yào nǐ péi bàn wǒ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    好想要你 想要你 想要你陪著我\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hǎo xiǎng yào nǐ xiǎng yào nǐ xiǎng yào nǐ péi zhe wǒ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    卻只能等候\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    què zhǐ néng děng hòu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">看<rt class=\"tli-rt\">콸ˋ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">魚仔<rt class=\"tli-rt\">희아ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">佇<rt class=\"tli-rt\">듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>햐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">泅<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슈-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">來<rt class=\"tli-rt\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">泅<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슈-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">去<rt class=\"tli-rt\">킈</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">泅<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슈-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">來<rt class=\"tli-rt\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">泅<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슈-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">去<rt class=\"tli-rt\">킈</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khoà̰-hi-à ti-hiâ siu-lai-siu-khi siu-lai-siu-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">對<rt class=\"tli-rt\">뒤ˋ</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">想<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슐-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">來<rt class=\"tli-rt\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">想<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슐-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">去<rt class=\"tli-rt